portant; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\" data-path-to-node=\"21,1,0,0\">No re-evaluation requests will be entertained unless a technical issue is formally reported.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\" data-path-to-node=\"21,2,0,0\">In case of a tie, bonus questions or time-based tiebreakers may be used.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\" data-path-to-node=\"21,3,0,0\">Certificates, prizes, or recognitions will be awarded as per the competition's announcement.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>A surprise <strong style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\" data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"11\">Bounty Segment</strong> will be introduced during the quiz to add an extra layer of challenge to the competition.</p>\n<p>Further details will be revealed during the event.</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\" data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Prizes Worth: ₹15,000 INR</strong></p>",
